#!/usr/bin/env python3
# mango-config — a friendly GTK4 settings app for the Mango Wayland compositor.
# Edits only the files your config.conf actually sources, validates with
# `mango -p`, keeps timestamped backups, and reloads through Mango's IPC socket.
# Optional Wallpaper and Night light pages talk to swaybg/light-wallpaper and
# gammastep without touching the Mango config.
